            make_q("What is Advantage Actor-Critic (A2C)?", ["The synchronous, deterministic counterpart to A3C that batches environments together and updates synchronously, achieving equal or superior performance on modern GPUs", "An architecture with 2 critics", "A model with 2-bit weights", "A method for audio processing"], 0, "A2C synchronizes worker steps, making full use of GPU matrix parallelism and eliminating the asynchronous gradient staleness of A3C."),
